WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.700
I'm Stefan. Nice to meet you.

2
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:04.180
If you're watching this, it means
I just handed you a QR code

3
00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:05.620
or maybe somebody shared a link.

4
00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:06.980
Either way, hi.

5
00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:09.400
And I know this is
not a normal move,

6
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:10.660
but I'm a magician.

7
00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:12.700
So normal was never an option.

8
00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:14.100
Here's the deal.

9
00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:16.190
I am ready to find my person

10
00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:18.190
and to share this
crazy life with her.

11
00:00:18.190 --> 00:00:19.540
And I know myself pretty well.

12
00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:21.220
I fall in love fast.

13
00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:22.500
And that can be wonderful,

14
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:24.420
but it can also mean chemistry

15
00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:26.580
can talk me out of just asking

16
00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:28.340
the hard questions, right?

17
00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:30.740
So instead of finding
out the answers

18
00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:32.340
three months in,

19
00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:34.660
I made a short
little questionnaire.

20
00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:35.780
So, about three minutes long.

21
00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:37.620
No wrong answers at all,

22
00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:38.900
just honest ones.

23
00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:42.740
It's not about finding
someone perfect, okay?

24
00:00:42.740 --> 00:00:43.620
I'm not perfect.

25
00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:48.180
It's about finding if your weird
could match my weird.

26
00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:50.980
So if your vision of life
could match mine.

27
00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:52.180
And I hope so.

28
00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:53.380
And that would be great.

29
00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:55.760
So if you'd like to find out,
tap below.
